= f(x) + g(x)u, ] with \[\begin{equation}
  f(x)
  =
  \begin{bmatrix}
    \dot{q} \\[0.2em]
    \left[a_{\mathrm{drift}}(x)\right]_{1:n} \\[0.2em]
    \dot{\eta} \\[0.2em]
    \left[a_{\mathrm{drift}}(x)\right]_{n+1:n+m}
  \end{bmatrix},
\end{equation}\] \[\begin{equation}
