       + \frac{1}{2} m_\eta \dot{\eta}^2
       + \text{(coupling terms)},\\
  V &= m g L_{\mathrm{eff}}(\eta) (1 - \cos\theta)
       + \frac{1}{2} k_\eta \eta^2,
\end{align}\] where (I_{}) and (L_{}) capture the effect of shaft deformation on the effective inertia and center of mass. The exact forms are not required to demonstrate linearity in (u).
The resulting equations of motion can be written schematically as: \[\begin{equation}
