    0
  \end{bmatrix},
  \label{eq:pendulum_flex_block}
\end{equation}\] where (k_) and (c_) are the modal stiffness and damping derived from (,), and all coupling terms have been absorbed into the matrices (M,C,G).
Solving for accelerations: \[\begin{equation}
